## Preserve shared deletion-reason precedence

Context: Version-card listing code locally replaced deletion block reasons for
latest versions, diverging from the authoritative shared policy when deletion
constraints overlap. Listings now preserve the helper's minimum-version,
loaded-version, latest-version, and lifecycle-status precedence.

Changes:

1. src/back/objects/domain/Domain.py
   Removed the local latest-version reason override from Domain card capabilities.
2. src/back/objects/domain/SettingsService.py
   Removed the local latest-version reason override from Registry card decoration.
3. tests/units/domain/test_version_capabilities.py
   Added shared-policy parity coverage for loaded/latest and sole/loaded/latest overlapping states.

