## Redesign Domain Versions as an action-card workspace

Context: Domain → Versions now presents version history as a full-height,
responsive card workspace. Each card renders server-provided lifecycle and
deletion capabilities directly, with inline load, transition, and guarded
delete actions.

Changes:

1. src/front/templates/partials/domain/_domain_versions.html
   Replaced the version table and inline handlers with semantic list states, accessible cards, and delegated action controls.
2. src/front/static/domain/css/domain-versions.css
   Added token-based full-height internal scrolling with specificity-safe mobile natural-flow resets.
3. src/front/static/domain/js/domain-versions.js
   Added capability-driven card rendering, lifecycle transitions, guarded deletion, state handling, retry support, and delegated events while preserving the shared New Version action.
4. src/front/templates/domain.html
   Wired the cache-busted Domain Versions stylesheet after the Domain Review styles.
5. tests/units/front/test_domain_versions_cards.py
   Added structural, responsive, capability-rendering, and endpoint contracts for the card workspace.

